{"id":"02e63e1e-d684-f111-ab0e-6045bdd9b85f","fromAddress":"supportmail@techsupport.microsoft.com","subject":"[S-7478] Container 에 blob data contributor 권한 부... - TrackingID#2607210030002416","createdDate":"2026-07-21T07:31:00Z","updatedDate":"2026-07-21T07:31:07Z","body":"<div class=\"ck-content\" data-wrapper=\"true\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"--ck-image-style-spacing: 1.5em; --ck-inline-image-style-spacing: calc(var(--ck-image-style-spacing) / 2); font-family: Segoe UI; font-size: 11pt;\"><p style=\"margin: 0in;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 0in; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;굴림&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><img style=\"height:auto;max-width:100%;width:207px;\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"Picture 566436030, Picture\" width=\"207\" height=\"61\" v:shapes=\"그림_x0020_6\" uploadprocessed=\"true\"></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;굴림&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span>&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span lang=\"KO\">안녕하세요</span><span>&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"KO\">백광제 고객님</span><span>, </span><span lang=\"KO\">저희 고객기술지원 서비스를 이용해 주셔서 감사합니다</span><span>. </span><span lang=\"KO\">저는 이 케이스를 지원할 한국마이크로소프트 고객기술지원 엔지니어 문소영입니다</span><span>. </span><span lang=\"KO\">서명란의 연락처를 통해 언제나 연락주실 수 있습니다</span><span>.&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span>&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span lang=\"KO\">문의하신 사항에 대해 아래와 같이 정리합니다</span><span>. </span><span lang=\"KO\">내용을 살펴보시고 잘못 이해하였거나</span><span>, </span><span lang=\"KO\">궁금하신 점이 있다면 알려주시기 바랍니다</span><span>. </span><span lang=\"KO\">빠른 확인 및 시스템 기록을 위해 반드시 전체 회신</span><span>(supportmail@techsupport.microsoft.com</span></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span>\u202F</span></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span lang=\"KO\">포함</span><span>)</span><span lang=\"KO\">으로 응답 부탁드립니다</span><span>.&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span><img style=\"height:auto;max-width:100%;width:914px;\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAA5IAAAACCAYAAAAq/+PMAAAAAXNSR0IArs4c6QAAAARnQU1BAACxjwv8YQUAAAAJcEhZcwAADsMAAA7DAcdvqGQAAAAuSURBVFhH7cNBDQAgDASw+6F/CjYrKAMJIKBNmpk5qqqq+trdu6pWAAAA4F9yATrNP18epu7XAAAAAElFTkSuQmCC\" alt=\"Shape\" width=\"914\" height=\"2\" v:shapes=\"그림_x0020_5\" uploadprocessed=\"true\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><b><span lang=\"KO\"><u>문의 사항</u></span><span><u>:</u></span></b><span>&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span>&nbsp;build-external container </span><span lang=\"KO\">에</span><span> blob data contributor </span><span lang=\"KO\">권한을 할당한</span><span> Managed Identity </span><span lang=\"KO\">를 이용하여</span><span>, VM </span><span lang=\"KO\">에서</span><span> Managed Identity </span><span lang=\"KO\">로 로그인 후</span><span> az storage blob list </span><span lang=\"KO\">명령어 수행 시</span><span> 'Response status|AuthorizationFailure' </span><span lang=\"KO\">에러 발생</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span lang=\"KO\">자체 확인한 사항</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span>- </span><span lang=\"KO\">네트워크</span><span>: Private Endpoint(pe-staz02amlliamak02-blob-01, 10.249.24.108) </span><span lang=\"KO\">및</span><span> Private DNS</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span>&nbsp; A </span><span lang=\"KO\">레코드 정상 등록 확인</span><span>, TLS handshake </span><span lang=\"KO\">성공 확인함</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span>- </span><span lang=\"KO\">컨테이너</span><span>/</span><span lang=\"KO\">데이터 자체 문제 여부</span><span>: </span><span lang=\"KO\">계정 키</span><span>(Shared Key)</span><span lang=\"KO\">로 우회 접근 시에는 정상 조회됨</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span>&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><b><span lang=\"KO\"><u>진행 사항</u></span><span><u>:</u></span></b><span>&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span>AuthorizationFailure </span><span lang=\"KO\">오류가 발생한</span><span> VM</span><span lang=\"KO\">에서 아래 항목을 수행하신 후 결과를 공유해 주시면 감사하겠습니다</span><span>.</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span>1. DNS </span><span lang=\"KO\">이름 확인 결과</span><span> (</span><span lang=\"KO\">요청이 실제로</span><span> Private Endpoint</span><span lang=\"KO\">로 향하는지 확인</span><span>)</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:Consolas;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span>nslookup staz02amlliamak02.blob.core.windows.net</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span>2. </span><span lang=\"KO\">정확한 오류 코드와 요청</span><span> ID</span><span lang=\"KO\">가 포함된 실제 서버 응답</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:Consolas;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span>az storage blob list --account-name staz02amlliamak02 --container-name build-external --auth-mode login --debug 2&gt; debug.log</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span>3. </span><span lang=\"KO\">테스트에 사용된 로그인</span><span> ID</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:Consolas;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span>az account show</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span>4. </span><span lang=\"KO\">실제 통신 경로 확인</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:Consolas;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span>Test-NetConnection staz02amlliamak02.blob.core.windows.net -Port 443</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span>5. </span><span lang=\"KO\">인증</span><span>(</span><span lang=\"KO\">토큰 발급</span><span>) </span><span lang=\"KO\">자체 정상 여부 확인</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:Consolas;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span>az account get-access-token --resource&nbsp;</span></span><a href=\"https://storage.azure.com/\"><span style=\"font-family:Consolas;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span>https://storage.azure.com/</span></span></a></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span lang=\"KO\">debug.log등의 파일은 해당 링크로 공유 부탁드립니다</span><span>:&nbsp;</span></span><a href=\"https://support.microsoft.com/files?workspace=eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6IjRDNDlERjM3REYxMzc3MDI3RjQ2NzY1NDVEQzc5ODFCMUE5Mzc1MTgiLCJ0eXAiOiJKV1QifQ..J-LqnC95IL_BH50dmaJd7nXLZFre7Mnli23bWGoA03fyyohvu3bTD1MX3bWrKiU3QVt66tyEGBkIcM6AnMmAzc_U3FTFQ51tWHvhifPyd-HmYN00psil7NLzewKW5jMw_Q8LToTzpwXQ0tt3Y1hYoEg7oIjKJvq3NJFLdgKBwiJygB634uGRgtzFDkWqist6dIhfHLoNp_2YtDfWB9r2tAyd4WHNKe1ijbLPKpBWCKhKo_hBrXXrp5